### Signup
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/emailpass/register
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv TESTING_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testing124",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "title": "Dr.",
  "city": "Testing City",
  "mobileNumber": "123-456-7890",
  "pfpUrl": "https://testing.com",
  "unitId": "{{$dotenv TESTING_UNIT_ID}}"
}


### Login

POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/emailpass
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv TESTING_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testing124"
}